{"2972760": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Ultimate Jello Party", "steam_appid": 2972760, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2972760/extras/df38d4ae58e1fdb3034117feeb086365.avif?t=1788226560\" width=640 height=80 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ULTIMATE JELLO PARTY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ultimate Jello Party is a multiplayer party game that combines elements of card, board and minigame battles. Earn coins, plan your strategy and accumulate Jellos to win this chaotic competition full of nostalgic parodies for up to 4 players!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2972760/extras/05d58b0174f0976b0d794fdfc47a419c.poster.avif?t=1788226560\" width=640 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2972760/extras/05d58b0174f0976b0d794fdfc47a419c.webm?t=1788226560\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2972760/extras/05d58b0174f0976b0d794fdfc47a419c.mp4?t=1788226560\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >USE CARTRIDGES TO ADVANCE ON THE BOARD AND CAUSE CHAOS WITH YOUR FRIENDS!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the beginning of each turn, players receive a chest containing new cartridges. These can be used to choose new routes, disturb your friends, protect yourself or find interactible events!<br>A misterious merchant lurks to offer special and rare cartridges! Surprise is a constant factor and you never know what crazy course a match can take!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2972760/extras/d291d5ea81fe8e50d6ae8b777fbab4c2.poster.avif?t=1788226560\" width=640 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2972760/extras/d291d5ea81fe8e50d6ae8b777fbab4c2.webm?t=1788226560\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2972760/extras/d291d5ea81fe8e50d6ae8b777fbab4c2.mp4?t=1788226560\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAY MINIGAMES TO WIN PRIZES IN COINS! DON'T FORGET TO PRACTICE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of every board round, players battle in a thrilling minigame! Win to gather a prize in coins, that can be exchanged for cartridges, bargained in event spaces, and of course, <strong>Jellos</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2972760/extras/d8f5de99eab6b858aae13442ff150852.poster.avif?t=1788226560\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2972760/extras/d8f5de99eab6b858aae13442ff150852.mp4?t=1788226560\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE PLAYER WHAT COLLECTS THE MOST JELLO WINS!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main way of getting Jellos is buying with coins when you pass trough it's space.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHECK OUT OUR AMAZING LIST OF FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with up to 3 additional friends in local or online multiplayer!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Marvelous handmande pixel-art graphics!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >16 diabolically crafted minigames for you and your friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Coolest Soundtrack Ever <strong>™</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nostalgic Easter Eggs: Gotta find 'em all!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Super ultra trained bots: programmed to either get brutally crushed OR make you wonder if you even know how to hold a controller</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click on everything and see what happens!</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2972760/extras/df38d4ae58e1fdb3034117feeb086365.avif?t=1788226560\" width=640 height=80 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ULTIMATE JELLO PARTY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ultimate Jello Party is a multiplayer party game that combines elements of card, board and minigame battles. Earn coins, plan your strategy and accumulate Jellos to win this chaotic competition full of nostalgic parodies for up to 4 players!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2972760/extras/05d58b0174f0976b0d794fdfc47a419c.poster.avif?t=1788226560\" width=640 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2972760/extras/05d58b0174f0976b0d794fdfc47a419c.webm?t=1788226560\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2972760/extras/05d58b0174f0976b0d794fdfc47a419c.mp4?t=1788226560\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >USE CARTRIDGES TO ADVANCE ON THE BOARD AND CAUSE CHAOS WITH YOUR FRIENDS!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the beginning of each turn, players receive a chest containing new cartridges. These can be used to choose new routes, disturb your friends, protect yourself or find interactible events!<br>A misterious merchant lurks to offer special and rare cartridges! Surprise is a constant factor and you never know what crazy course a match can take!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2972760/extras/d291d5ea81fe8e50d6ae8b777fbab4c2.poster.avif?t=1788226560\" width=640 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2972760/extras/d291d5ea81fe8e50d6ae8b777fbab4c2.webm?t=1788226560\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2972760/extras/d291d5ea81fe8e50d6ae8b777fbab4c2.mp4?t=1788226560\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAY MINIGAMES TO WIN PRIZES IN COINS! DON'T FORGET TO PRACTICE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of every board round, players battle in a thrilling minigame! Win to gather a prize in coins, that can be exchanged for cartridges, bargained in event spaces, and of course, <strong>Jellos</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2972760/extras/d8f5de99eab6b858aae13442ff150852.poster.avif?t=1788226560\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2972760/extras/d8f5de99eab6b858aae13442ff150852.mp4?t=1788226560\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE PLAYER WHAT COLLECTS THE MOST JELLO WINS!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main way of getting Jellos is buying with coins when you pass trough it's space.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHECK OUT OUR AMAZING LIST OF FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with up to 3 additional friends in local or online multiplayer!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Marvelous handmande pixel-art graphics!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >16 diabolically crafted minigames for you and your friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Coolest Soundtrack Ever <strong>™</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nostalgic Easter Eggs: Gotta find 'em all!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Super ultra trained bots: programmed to either get brutally crushed OR make you wonder if you even know how to hold a controller</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click on everything and see what happens!</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Ultimate Jello Party is a multiplayer party game that combines elements of card, board and minigame battles. Earn coins, plan your strategy and accumulate Jellos to win this chaotic competition full of nostalgic parodies for up to 4 players!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Brazil<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2972760/header.jpg?t=1788226560", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2972760/0605212ef2f68a19399e53590d9ccd1f40e7d59e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788226560", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2972760/0605212ef2f68a19399e53590d9ccd1f40e7d59e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788226560", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> XP<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Core 2 Duo<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Discreet video card<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Yes</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 8 / 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.4 GHz Quad Core 2.0 (or higher)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB de RAM GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Int